From: s1oplus <victorgarcez@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:00:59 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Accept the locally built kernels and boot base

The kernels are built from the accepted final tree; their release string
carries the local replay's commit. The boot base is rebuilt from Alpine's
static BusyBox and e2fsprogs 1.47.2, since the starter release is not
published, and passes verify_base.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
